Project Scenario
You are working as a junior IT technician.
A new employee has received a computer, but the computer is not fully configured.
Some devices do not work correctly, office software is not installed, and the computer
needs basic security protection.
Your task is to prepare the computer for everyday professional use.
You must complete three stages of the project.

